        "One barber.One chair.Your full hour.",
        "Chair and Blade is a private barbering studio built around a simple idea: no queues, no distractions, no rushing you out the door. Every appointment is one-to-one, start to finish, with me and only me.",
        "Today at a Glance",
        "StudioPrivate, single chair",
        "BookingBy appointment only",
