      "text": [
        "Priced honestly. Booked one at a time.",
        "No add-on menus or upsells — just the cuts and grooming done properly, in a slot that's entirely yours.",
        "Signature Cut",
        "Consultation, precision cut, and finish — tailored to your hair, face shape, and how you actually style it at home.",
        "Cut & Beard Shape",
        "The Signature Cut paired with a straight-razor beard line-up and hot towel finish.",
        "Skin Fade",
        "Zero-blend skin fade with detailed finishing work around the ears and neckline.",
        "Beard Trim & Hot Towel",
        "Shape, trim, and straight-razor edging finished with a hot towel and balm.",
        "First Visit Consultation Cut",
        "A longer first appointment so we can talk through what's worked, what hasn't, and set a plan for future visits."
      ]
