        "How a booking at Chair and Blade actually works.",
        "Book Your Slot",
        "Pick a day and time that suits you. Because there's only one chair, that slot is held for you alone — no double-booking, no overlap.",
        "Arrive, Sit Down",
        "No waiting area small talk with strangers. You arrive close to your appointment time and we get straight into it.",
        "Leave on Time, Done Properly",
        "Your full hour (or however long the service takes) is spent on you. Nothing rushed, nothing skipped, no next client waiting behind you."
      ]
